{"version":1,"entries":[{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Sub プロシージャ","summary":"値を返さない処理のまとまり。マクロとして実行できます。","examples":[{"code":"Sub Hello()\n  MsgBox \"こんにちは\"\nEnd Sub","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0001"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Function プロシージャ","summary":"値を返す処理のまとまり。ワークシート関数としても使えます。","examples":[{"code":"Function Tax(p As Long) As Long\n  Tax = p * 0.1\nEnd Function","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0002"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Dim","summary":"変数を宣言します。型を指定すると間違いに気づきやすくなります。","examples":[{"code":"Dim n As Long\nDim s As String","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0003"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Option Explicit","summary":"変数の宣言を必須にする指定。タイプミスによるバグを防ぎます。常に先頭に書くのがおすすめです。","examples":[{"code":"Option Explicit","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0004"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Const","summary":"変更できない定数を宣言します。","examples":[{"code":"Const TAX_RATE As Double = 0.1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0005"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Public / Private","summary":"プロシージャや変数の公開範囲を決めます。","examples":[{"code":"Private Sub Helper()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0006"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"コメント '","summary":"シングルクォート以降は実行されません。","examples":[{"code":"' メモ","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0007"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"行継続 _","summary":"長い文を次の行に続けます。（半角スペース＋アンダースコア）","examples":[{"code":"x = 1 + _\n    2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0008"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"MsgBox","summary":"メッセージを表示します。ボタンの種類も選べます。","examples":[{"code":"MsgBox \"完了しました\", vbInformation","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0009"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"InputBox","summary":"入力欄付きのダイアログを表示します。","examples":[{"code":"s = InputBox(\"名前は？\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0010"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Debug.Print","summary":"イミディエイトウィンドウに出力します。","examples":[{"code":"Debug.Print n","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0011"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"VBE（Visual Basic Editor）","summary":"マクロを書く編集画面。Alt+F11 で開きます。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0012"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"マクロの記録","summary":"操作をそのままコードにする機能。コードの書き方を学ぶのに役立ちます。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0013"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"マクロ有効ブック .xlsm","summary":"マクロを保存できるブックの形式。通常の .xlsx には保存できません。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0014"},{"lang":"vba","category":"基本","term":"Application.Run","summary":"名前を指定してマクロを実行します。","examples":[{"code":"Application.Run \"Hello\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0015"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Long / Integer","summary":"整数型。Long（約±21億）の使用がおすすめです。","examples":[{"code":"Dim i As Long","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0016"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Double / Single","summary":"小数型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim d As Double","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0017"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"String","summary":"文字列型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim s As String","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0018"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Boolean","summary":"True / False を持つ型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim ok As Boolean","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0019"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Date","summary":"日付・時刻型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim d As Date","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0020"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Variant","summary":"どんな値でも入る型。宣言なしの変数の型です。便利ですが誤りに気づきにくい。","examples":[{"code":"Dim v As Variant","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0021"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Object","summary":"オブジェクトを入れる型。Set で代入します。","examples":[{"code":"Dim ws As Worksheet\nSet ws = Worksheets(\"Sheet1\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0022"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Set","summary":"オブジェクト変数への代入に使います。","examples":[{"code":"Set rng = Range(\"A1\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0023"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"配列","summary":"同じ型の値の並び。","examples":[{"code":"Dim a(1 To 3) As Long","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0024"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"動的配列 ReDim","summary":"大きさを後から決める配列。Preserve で中身を保持。","examples":[{"code":"ReDim Preserve a(1 To n)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0025"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"ユーザー定義型 Type","summary":"複数の項目をまとめた型。","examples":[{"code":"Type P\n  Name As String\n  Age As Long\nEnd Type","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0026"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Enum","summary":"名前付きの定数群。","examples":[{"code":"Enum Color\n  Red = 1\n  Blue = 2\nEnd Enum","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0027"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Collection","summary":"項目を追加・参照できる入れ物。","examples":[{"code":"Dim c As New Collection\nc.Add \"a\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0028"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"Dictionary","summary":"キーで値を管理する入れ物（Scripting.Dictionary）。","examples":[{"code":"Dim d As Object\nSet d = CreateObject(\"Scripting.Dictionary\")\nd(\"a\") = 1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0029"},{"lang":"vba","category":"データ型","term":"型変換関数","summary":"CLng, CDbl, CStr, CDate など。","examples":[{"code":"CLng(\"12\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0030"},{"lang":"vba","category":"演算子","term":"& （文字列連結）","summary":"文字列をつなぎます。","examples":[{"code":"\"a\" & \"b\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0031"},{"lang":"vba","category":"演算子","term":"Mod / ¥","summary":"割り算のあまり／整数除算。","examples":[{"code":"7 Mod 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0032"},{"lang":"vba","category":"演算子","term":"Like","summary":"ワイルドカードを使った文字列比較。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\" Like \"a*\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0033"},{"lang":"vba","category":"演算子","term":"And / Or / Not","summary":"論理演算。Or は両方を評価します。","examples":[{"code":"If a > 0 And b > 0 Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0034"},{"lang":"vba","category":"演算子","term":"Is / TypeName","summary":"オブジェクトの比較／型名の取得。","examples":[{"code":"If obj Is Nothing Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0035"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"If...Then...Else","summary":"条件分岐。","examples":[{"code":"If n > 0 Then\n  MsgBox \"正\"\nElse\n  MsgBox \"他\"\nEnd If","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0036"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"Select Case","summary":"値で分岐します。範囲や複数の値も指定可。","examples":[{"code":"Select Case n\n  Case 1 To 3: s = \"小\"\n  Case Else: s = \"他\"\nEnd Select","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0037"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"For...Next","summary":"回数を決めた繰り返し。","examples":[{"code":"For i = 1 To 10\n  Cells(i, 1) = i\nNext i","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0038"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"For Each","summary":"コレクションやセルを順に処理。","examples":[{"code":"For Each c In Range(\"A1:A10\")\n  c.Value = c.Value * 2\nNext","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0039"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"Do While / Do Until","summary":"条件が真の間／偽の間、繰り返す。","examples":[{"code":"Do While i <= 10\n  i = i + 1\nLoop","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0040"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"Exit For / Exit Do / Exit Sub","summary":"途中で抜ける。","examples":[{"code":"If x = 0 Then Exit Sub","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0041"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"GoTo / ラベル","summary":"ラベルへ飛ぶ。エラー処理で使うことが多い。","examples":[{"code":"GoTo Done","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0042"},{"lang":"vba","category":"制御構文","term":"With...End With","summary":"同じオブジェクトへの操作をまとめて書く。","examples":[{"code":"With Range(\"A1\")\n  .Value = 1\n  .Font.Bold = True\nEnd With","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0043"},{"lang":"vba","category":"エラー処理","term":"On Error GoTo","summary":"エラー発生時に指定ラベルへ移動します。","examples":[{"code":"On Error GoTo ErrHandler\n...\nExit Sub\nErrHandler:\n  MsgBox Err.Description","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0044"},{"lang":"vba","category":"エラー処理","term":"On Error Resume Next","summary":"エラーを無視して続行。使いすぎるとバグを見逃すので範囲を限定します。","examples":[{"code":"On Error Resume Next","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0045"},{"lang":"vba","category":"エラー処理","term":"On Error GoTo 0","summary":"エラー処理を解除して通常に戻す。","examples":[{"code":"On Error GoTo 0","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0046"},{"lang":"vba","category":"エラー処理","term":"Err オブジェクト","summary":"直近のエラー番号と説明を持つ。","examples":[{"code":"Err.Number\nErr.Description","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0047"},{"lang":"vba","category":"エラー処理","term":"Err.Raise","summary":"自分でエラーを発生させます。","examples":[{"code":"Err.Raise 513, , \"入力が不正です\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0048"},{"lang":"vba","category":"エラー処理","term":"ブレークポイント / ステップ実行","summary":"F9 で停止位置、F8 で1行ずつ実行して確認できます。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0049"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Range","summary":"セル範囲を指定。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1:B5\").Value = 0","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0050"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Cells(行, 列)","summary":"行と列の番号でセルを指定。ループ処理に便利です。","examples":[{"code":"Cells(2, 3).Value = \"x\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0051"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Value / Value2 / Text","summary":"セルの値／日付通貨を変換しない値／表示された文字。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").Value","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0052"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Formula / FormulaR1C1","summary":"セルに数式を設定します。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"C1\").Formula = \"=A1+B1\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0053"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Offset","summary":"基準セルからの相対位置にあるセル。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").Offset(1, 0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0054"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Resize","summary":"範囲の大きさを変更します。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").Resize(3, 2)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0055"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"End(xlUp)","summary":"最終行を探すときの定番。Ctrl+↑ に相当。","examples":[{"code":"last = Cells(Rows.Count, 1).End(xlUp).Row","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0056"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"UsedRange","summary":"使用されているセル範囲。","examples":[{"code":"ActiveSheet.UsedRange.Rows.Count","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0057"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"CurrentRegion","summary":"隣接するデータ全体の範囲。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").CurrentRegion","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0058"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"ClearContents / Clear","summary":"値だけ消す／書式も消す。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A2:C100\").ClearContents","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0059"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Copy / PasteSpecial","summary":"コピーと形式を選んで貼り付け。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").Copy\nRange(\"B1\").PasteSpecial xlPasteValues","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0060"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Delete / Insert","summary":"行・列・セルの削除と挿入。","examples":[{"code":"Rows(3).Delete","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0061"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Rows / Columns","summary":"行や列全体を指す。","examples":[{"code":"Columns(\"B\").ColumnWidth = 20","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0062"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"AutoFit","summary":"内容に合わせて幅・高さを自動調整。","examples":[{"code":"Columns(\"A:C\").AutoFit","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0063"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Merge / UnMerge","summary":"セルの結合／解除。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1:C1\").Merge","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0064"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Interior.Color","summary":"背景色を設定。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").Interior.Color = RGB(255, 255, 0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0065"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Font","summary":"フォントの大きさ、太字、色を設定。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").Font.Bold = True","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0066"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"NumberFormat","summary":"表示形式を設定。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").NumberFormat = \"#,##0\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0067"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Borders","summary":"罫線を設定。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1:C3\").Borders.LineStyle = xlContinuous","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0068"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"Find","summary":"セル範囲から値を探します。見つからないと Nothing。","examples":[{"code":"Set f = Range(\"A:A\").Find(\"検索語\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0069"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"SpecialCells","summary":"空白・数式・エラーなどの特定のセルだけを取得。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1:A100\").SpecialCells(xlCellTypeBlanks)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0070"},{"lang":"vba","category":"セルと範囲","term":"名前の定義 Names","summary":"範囲に名前を付けます。","examples":[{"code":"ThisWorkbook.Names.Add \"税率\", \"=Sheet1!$A$1\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0071"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Worksheets","summary":"シートを名前や番号で指定。","examples":[{"code":"Worksheets(\"Sheet1\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0072"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"ActiveSheet / ThisWorkbook","summary":"選択中のシート／マクロが入っているブック。","examples":[{"code":"ThisWorkbook.Worksheets(1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0073"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Worksheets.Add","summary":"シートを追加。","examples":[{"code":"Worksheets.Add.Name = \"新規\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0074"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Sheet.Delete","summary":"シートを削除。確認メッセージを DisplayAlerts で抑えます。","examples":[{"code":"Application.DisplayAlerts = False","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0075"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Workbooks.Open","summary":"別のブックを開く。","examples":[{"code":"Set wb = Workbooks.Open(\"C:\\data\\a.xlsx\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0076"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Workbook.Close","summary":"ブックを閉じる。SaveChanges で保存有無を指定。","examples":[{"code":"wb.Close SaveChanges:=False","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0077"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"SaveAs / SaveCopyAs","summary":"名前を付けて保存／コピーを保存。","examples":[{"code":"ThisWorkbook.SaveAs \"b.xlsx\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0078"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"ExportAsFixedFormat","summary":"PDF として出力します。","examples":[{"code":"ws.ExportAsFixedFormat xlTypePDF, \"a.pdf\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0079"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Protect / Unprotect","summary":"シートやブックの保護とその解除。","examples":[{"code":"ws.Protect \"pw\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0080"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Visible","summary":"シートの表示・非表示。","examples":[{"code":"ws.Visible = xlSheetHidden","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0081"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"ListObjects","summary":"テーブル機能を操作する。","examples":[{"code":"ws.ListObjects(1).ListRows.Count","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0082"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"AutoFilter","summary":"フィルターを設定。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").AutoFilter Field:=1, Criteria1:=\"東京\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0083"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Sort","summary":"データを並べ替える。","examples":[{"code":"ws.Sort.SortFields.Add Key:=Range(\"A1\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0084"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"PivotTable","summary":"ピボットテーブルを作成・操作。","examples":[{"code":"ws.PivotTableWizard","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0085"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"Charts / ChartObjects","summary":"グラフを作成・操作。","examples":[{"code":"ws.ChartObjects.Add(10, 10, 300, 200)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0086"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"条件付き書式 FormatConditions","summary":"条件に応じた書式を設定。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1:A10\").FormatConditions.Add Type:=xlCellValue, Operator:=xlGreater, Formula1:=\"=100\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0087"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"入力規則 Validation","summary":"入力できる値を制限。","examples":[{"code":"With Range(\"A1\").Validation\n  .Add xlValidateList, , , \"はい,いいえ\"\nEnd With","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0088"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ワークシートとブック","term":"コメントとメモ","summary":"セルへの注釈を追加。","examples":[{"code":"Range(\"A1\").AddComment \"メモ\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0089"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"Len / LenB","summary":"文字数／バイト数。","examples":[{"code":"Len(\"あいう\") ' 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0090"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"Left / Right / Mid","summary":"先頭／末尾／途中から指定文字数を取り出す。","examples":[{"code":"Mid(\"abcdef\", 2, 3) ' \"bcd\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0091"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"InStr / InStrRev","summary":"文字列の位置を探します。見つからないと0。","examples":[{"code":"InStr(\"abc\", \"b\") ' 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0092"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"Replace","summary":"文字列を置換。","examples":[{"code":"Replace(\"a-b\", \"-\", \"+\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0093"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"Trim / LTrim / RTrim","summary":"空白を除く。","examples":[{"code":"Trim(\" a \")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0094"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"UCase / LCase","summary":"大文字／小文字。","examples":[{"code":"UCase(\"abc\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0095"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"Split / Join","summary":"区切って配列に／配列をつなぐ。","examples":[{"code":"a = Split(\"a,b\", \",\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0096"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"Format","summary":"数値や日付を書式付き文字列に。","examples":[{"code":"Format(Date, \"yyyy/mm/dd\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0097"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"StrConv","summary":"全角・半角やひらがな・カタカナの変換。","examples":[{"code":"StrConv(s, vbNarrow)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0098"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"vbCrLf / vbTab","summary":"改行／タブの定数。","examples":[{"code":"\"a\" & vbCrLf & \"b\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0099"},{"lang":"vba","category":"文字列関数","term":"Chr / Asc","summary":"文字コードと文字の変換。","examples":[{"code":"Chr(65) ' \"A\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0100"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"Now / Date / Time","summary":"現在の日時／日付／時刻。","examples":[{"code":"Now","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0101"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"DateAdd / DateDiff","summary":"日付の加算／差の計算。","examples":[{"code":"DateAdd(\"m\", 1, Date)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0102"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"Year / Month / Day","summary":"日付から年・月・日を取り出す。","examples":[{"code":"Month(Date)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0103"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"DateSerial","summary":"年・月・日から日付を作ります。月末の計算にも便利です。","examples":[{"code":"DateSerial(2026, 3, 0) ' 2月末日","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0104"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"Weekday","summary":"曜日の番号を返す。","examples":[{"code":"Weekday(Date)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0105"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"Round / Int / Fix","summary":"丸め（銀行丸めに注意）／切り捨て。","examples":[{"code":"Round(2.5) ' 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0106"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"Rnd / Randomize","summary":"乱数。Randomize で種を初期化します。","examples":[{"code":"Randomize\nInt(Rnd * 6) + 1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0107"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"IsNumeric / IsDate / IsEmpty","summary":"値の種類を調べる。","examples":[{"code":"IsNumeric(\"12\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0108"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"WorksheetFunction","summary":"Excel のワークシート関数を VBA から使う。","examples":[{"code":"Application.WorksheetFunction.Sum(Range(\"A1:A10\"))","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0109"},{"lang":"vba","category":"日付と数値","term":"Evaluate","summary":"文字列の数式を計算して結果を得る。","examples":[{"code":"Evaluate(\"1+2\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0110"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ファイルとシステム","term":"Dir","summary":"ファイルの存在確認や一覧取得。","examples":[{"code":"If Dir(\"a.txt\") <> \"\" Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0111"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ファイルとシステム","term":"FileSystemObject","summary":"ファイルやフォルダを操作するオブジェクト。","examples":[{"code":"Set fso = CreateObject(\"Scripting.FileSystemObject\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0112"},{"lang":"vba","category":"ファイルとシステム","term":"Open ... For Input/Output","summary":"テキストファイルを読み書きする従来の方法。","examples":[{"code":"Open \"a.txt\" For Output As #1\nPrint 