ffice連携","term":"OnTime","summary":"指定時刻にマクロを実行。","examples":[{"code":"Application.OnTime Now + TimeValue(\"00:00:10\"), \"Hello\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0124"},{"lang":"vba","category":"Excel・Office連携","term":"Application.Wait / DoEvents","summary":"待機／他の処理に制御を渡す。","examples":[{"code":"DoEvents","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0125"},{"lang":"vba","category":"Excel・Office連携","term":"CreateObject(\"Outlook.Application\")","summary":"Outlook を操作してメールを作成。","examples":[{"code":"Set ol = CreateObject(\"Outlook.Application\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0126"},{"lang":"vba","category":"Excel・Office連携","term":"CreateObject(\"Word.Application\")","summary":"Word を操作。","examples":[{"code":"Set wd = CreateObject(\"Word.Application\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0127"},{"lang":"vba","category":"Excel・Office連携","term":"CreateObject(\"PowerPoint.Application\")","summary":"PowerPoint を操作。","examples":[{"code":"Set pp = CreateObject(\"PowerPoint.Application\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0128"},{"lang":"vba","category":"Excel・Office連携","term":"遅延バインディングと事前バインディング","summary":"CreateObject で実行時に結びつける方法と、参照設定して型を使う方法。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0129"},{"lang":"vba","category":"Excel・Office連携","term":"MSXML2.XMLHTTP","summary":"HTTP 通信で Web の情報を取得します。","examples":[{"code":"Set http = CreateObject(\"MSXML2.XMLHTTP\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0130"},{"lang":"vba","category":"Excel・Office連携","term":"ADO（ADODB.Connection）","summary":"データベースへ接続して SQL を実行。","examples":[{"code":"Set cn = CreateObject(\"ADODB.Connection\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0131"},{"lang":"vba","category":"イベントとフォーム","term":"Workbook_Open","summary":"ブックを開いたときに実行されるイベント。","examples":[{"code":"Private Sub Workbook_Open()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0132"},{"lang":"vba","category":"イベントとフォーム","term":"Worksheet_Change","summary":"セルが変更されたときに実行されるイベント。","examples":[{"code":"Private Sub Worksheet_Change(ByVal Target As Range)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vba-0